    <h1>Ironman training plans for 70.3 and 140.6</h1>
    <p>Long distance isn't trained by piling on kilometres until the body copes. It's trained with a sustainable intensity distribution, load blocks that rise and fall, and specific sessions that prepare you to swim, ride and run on the same day, on accumulated fatigue.</p>
    <p>These plans cover both distances on the circuit — half distance (70.3) and full distance (140.6), from your first one to advanced. All of them use a polarized 80/20 distribution and sync to your watch and head unit as structured workouts.</p>
